ery never acknowledges a record it couldn’t hand to every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, so a store that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":" set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delivery gives each record returned the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitive-value visibility and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the record had when the buffer dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}]